Name: ppp
Description: Point to Point Protocol (a.k.a. user-ppp)
URL: https://man.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=ppp&manpath=FreeBSD+15.0-RELEASE
Version: 15.0
License: NOASSERTION
Source: https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/usr.sbin/ppp?h=stable/15
